# P10 under WSLg, GtkBackend. Clicks the three P10 buttons by their text, not by position.
# Expected: Direct clicks 1, Covered clicks 1, Hidden clicks 1 (the opaque overlay is allowsHitTesting(false)), as actions/mac/P10-taplabel.actions.
# P10(WSLg,GtkBackend): 以文字而非位置點 P10 的三顆按鈕。預期:Direct 1、Covered 1、Hidden 1(不透明的覆蓋層是 allowsHitTesting(false)),同 actions/mac/P10-taplabel.actions。
